{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81b3-a834-d0e92e0152fe, is_toggleable: true }}
### **Command**: `strata diff`
  {{ ref: 98408165-56bd-4871-ab87-d80f5a25b83e }}
  **Description**: Compare two structures (candidates or `current`) as a grouped move list plus their variation-of-information distance.
  --{ ref: 98408165-56bd-4871-ab87-d80f5a25b83e }--
  {{ ref: 5537e58a-c684-49f3-8408-85d2a9f91a20 }}
  **Usage**: `strata diff --input result.json <a> <b>` where each reference is `mode/index` (e.g. `anchored/1`) or `current`.
  --{ ref: 5537e58a-c684-49f3-8408-85d2a9f91a20 }--
  {{ ref: 516f9bfe-819d-47f3-b28b-e10aa1c355a8 }}
  **Exit codes**: `0` printed; `1` bad reference or unreadable input.
  --{ ref: 516f9bfe-819d-47f3-b28b-e10aa1c355a8 }--
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81b3-a834-d0e92e0152fe }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81e4-9475-d6bc487d9d36, is_toggleable: true }}
### **Command**: `strata violations`
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8113-a3b8-c8f8e2ffeb44 }}
  **Description**: Report structural violations of the current codebase — the CI gate. Classes: `cycle`, `polarity`, `capacity`, `visibility`.
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8113-a3b8-c8f8e2ffeb44 }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81a2-bd97-eb3610032bb8 }}
  **Flags**:
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81a2-bd97-eb3610032bb8 }--
  {{ ref: b6f9a265-ebd0-48bf-8bea-b6b1240352b2, table_width: 3 }}
  | **Flag**            | **Default**   | **Meaning**                                               |
  | ------------------- | ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
  | `--root <path>`     | `.`           | repository root                                           |
  | `--config <path>`   | `./strata.toml` | configuration file (optional; defaults apply without one) |
  | `--jobs <n>`        | logical cores | parallelism for parsing                                   |
  | `--fail-on <classes>` | none          | comma-separated classes that trigger exit code `2`        |
  | `--format <f>`      | `table`       | `table` | `json`                                          |
  --{ ref: b6f9a265-ebd0-48bf-8bea-b6b1240352b2 }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8111-83ac-c1c745a6b451 }}
  **Exit codes**: `0` clean (or no `--fail-on`); `2` matched violations found; `1` runtime error. Capacity findings within ±10% of a cap are reported as `borderline` and never trigger `2`.
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8111-83ac-c1c745a6b451 }--
  {{ ref: 7db1bab1-95dd-4062-b149-503c2a9fa124 }}
  **Pipeline scope**: runs only the structural phases — extract, normalize, condense, capacity counting, polarity validation, and visibility derivation over the current tree. No clustering, packing, or diversification, and no seed: the candidate-free path is deterministic by construction and completes well inside the `analyze` budget.
  --{ ref: 7db1bab1-95dd-4062-b149-503c2a9fa124 }--
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81e4-9475-d6bc487d9d36 }--

{{ ref: d4556c9c-4f69-453f-b71e-59cdad0237b1, is_toggleable: true }}
