{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8157-80df-d539c117480b, is_toggleable: true }}
### Component: `ir`
  {{ ref: 97f4c4af-ca6e-4b03-aca1-26283dffc15e }}
  **Purpose**: The contract everything hangs on — language-agnostic node, edge, and container types plus snapshot hashing.
  --{ ref: 97f4c4af-ca6e-4b03-aca1-26283dffc15e }--
  {{ ref: 7a23c4aa-0de5-4e5f-9df6-54e19548530a }}
  **Responsibilities**:
  --{ ref: 7a23c4aa-0de5-4e5f-9df6-54e19548530a }--
  {{ ref: 5204eb0d-b759-4e6c-a633-44486dbcce8b }}
  - Define `Node`, `Edge`, `ContainerTree`, polarity, hardness, and visibility types
  --{ ref: 5204eb0d-b759-4e6c-a633-44486dbcce8b }--
  {{ ref: 9da44688-9e29-47d3-9730-5de523e74bd7 }}
  - Assemble, validate, and blake3-hash immutable snapshots
  --{ ref: 9da44688-9e29-47d3-9730-5de523e74bd7 }--
  {{ ref: a39b5a4e-f953-477d-9cf4-6a4bb3820de1 }}
  - Version the snapshot schema for forward compatibility
  --{ ref: a39b5a4e-f953-477d-9cf4-6a4bb3820de1 }--
  {{ ref: 191e4975-9f8e-4807-a2a8-5613136840a6 }}
  - Define the shared `Adapter` trait and `IrFragment` contract that all language adapters implement (FR-2)
  --{ ref: 191e4975-9f8e-4807-a2a8-5613136840a6 }--
  {{ ref: 442ecd87-c40a-48c0-8ba7-aa8f3a32c253 }}
  **Dependencies**: serde, blake3, smol_str — nothing internal.
  --{ ref: 442ecd87-c40a-48c0-8ba7-aa8f3a32c253 }--
  {{ ref: af08bff8-d89f-4101-9b60-5fc35611014f }}
  **Internal Structure**:
  --{ ref: af08bff8-d89f-4101-9b60-5fc35611014f }--
  {{ ref: 341169f5-e22a-4417-bd8e-2972c8b301d8 }}
  ```rust
  // the adapter-to-engine contract (abridged)
  pub struct IntermediateRepresentation {
    pub schema_version: u32,
    pub nodes: Vec<Node>,
    pub edges: Vec<Edge>,
    pub containers: ContainerTree, // file -> folder -> domain -> package -> package group
  }

  // an ir fragment is the same shape covering one adapter's slice of the codebase;
  // the engine merges fragments into the full ir, then validates it into a snapshot
  pub type IrFragment = IntermediateRepresentation;
  ```
  --{ ref: 341169f5-e22a-4417-bd8e-2972c8b301d8 }--
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8157-80df-d539c117480b }--

