  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81fb-ace7-ddcd89b1cb19 }}
  - Condensation, shattering, layering, clustering, packing, visibility derivation, test projection, scoring, diversification
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81fb-ace7-ddcd89b1cb19 }--
