### Component: `engine`
  {{ ref: d45fe4e9-92bc-4dca-9d34-89f9e7479532 }}
  **Purpose**: Pipeline orchestrator and the public library crate (`strata-engine`) — the only crate that knows both adapters and solver.
  --{ ref: d45fe4e9-92bc-4dca-9d34-89f9e7479532 }--
  {{ ref: 67eef7bf-3d56-4fad-837f-f77471273a61 }}
  **Responsibilities**:
  --{ ref: 67eef7bf-3d56-4fad-837f-f77471273a61 }--
  {{ ref: 446879f8-0f19-4eaa-93ac-22a0c23a6b45 }}
  - Discover sources, dispatch adapters in parallel, merge fragments, hash the snapshot
  --{ ref: 446879f8-0f19-4eaa-93ac-22a0c23a6b45 }--
  {{ ref: 6e4bf223-1a80-4bac-8f50-3d78423356d9 }}
  - Load and validate configuration; apply defaults
  --{ ref: 6e4bf223-1a80-4bac-8f50-3d78423356d9 }--
  {{ ref: 33bb16a2-231c-4a8c-9249-679f20ab58a4 }}
  - Run core phases in order; assemble the `AnalyzeResult` DTO with delta narration
  --{ ref: 33bb16a2-231c-4a8c-9249-679f20ab58a4 }--
  {{ ref: 3a7fa0d8-4bf1-4575-ad8e-22d87d1ac682 }}
  - Expose the stable programmatic surface: `analyze`, `snapshot_from_root`, `load_config`, plus re-exported `ir` types
  --{ ref: 3a7fa0d8-4bf1-4575-ad8e-22d87d1ac682 }--
  {{ ref: 7437d3dc-010d-4fad-be90-95483adef6f4 }}
  **Dependencies**: `ir`, `core`, all adapters; serde, toml, rayon.
  --{ ref: 7437d3dc-010d-4fad-be90-95483adef6f4 }--
  {{ ref: 3adc8978-b854-4bdf-af69-8107dbb0b35d }}
  **Internal Structure**: `analyze(snapshot, config) -> AnalyzeResult` is a pure function; source discovery and parsing live behind a separate `snapshot_from_root(root, config)` entry so consumers with pre-built snapshots can skip parsing.
  --{ ref: 3adc8978-b854-4bdf-af69-8107dbb0b35d }--
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81ff-8362-d0f33cc8e856 }--

