{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81c5-b9f6-dda05f8cb259 }}
## 🚨 Error Reference
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81c5-b9f6-dda05f8cb259 }--

{{ ref: 1ac85f0a-5850-4e72-9c93-65c73eb3ed63 }}
All errors are variants of the public `StrataError` enum re-exported by `strata-engine`; the CLI maps them to exit code `1` (`2` is reserved for `violations --fail-on` matches). Strata is a standalone Rust workspace, so the TypeScript `@theriety/core` error taxonomy does not apply here — the enum mirrors its `code`-field convention instead (AD-8 in Dev Notes).
--{ ref: 1ac85f0a-5850-4e72-9c93-65c73eb3ed63 }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81d4-8abf-e7b2538fbc53, is_toggleable: true }}
### `ConfigInvalid` (code: CONFIG_INVALID)
  {{ ref: 6fcd94e1-ab0a-4a2f-b533-7afde4329e65 }}
  **When thrown**: `strata.toml` or a programmatically built `AnalyzeConfig` fails validation.
  --{ ref: 6fcd94e1-ab0a-4a2f-b533-7afde4329e65 }--
  {{ ref: 7aecb364-124d-4d67-a4c4-500994aaa211 }}
  **Common causes**:
  --{ ref: 7aecb364-124d-4d67-a4c4-500994aaa211 }--
  {{ ref: 9111a157-6743-4e0b-bf93-c7db8afc5b2d }}
  - unknown key or out-of-range coefficient
  --{ ref: 9111a157-6743-4e0b-bf93-c7db8afc5b2d }--
  {{ ref: 4dd78bcd-35e9-4af4-998c-1b790fc8a70f }}
  - unknown violation class in `--fail-on`
  --{ ref: 4dd78bcd-35e9-4af4-998c-1b790fc8a70f }--
  {{ ref: 2e03ce14-0275-4ec4-97d3-7925bbf6ddaa }}
  **Resolution**: fix the key reported with its TOML path; run with no config to fall back to defaults.
  --{ ref: 2e03ce14-0275-4ec4-97d3-7925bbf6ddaa }--
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81d4-8abf-e7b2538fbc53 }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81e2-9332-d6ca563a9700, is_toggleable: true }}
### `AdapterParseFailure` (code: ADAPTER_PARSE_FAILURE)
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8159-a737-d767d2c2db4e }}
  **When thrown**: a source file cannot be parsed by its language adapter.
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8159-a737-d767d2c2db4e }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-818e-9e2a-ff7f9a5945fe }}
  **Common causes**:
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-818e-9e2a-ff7f9a5945fe }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8118-9faa-c5832cd60588 }}
  - syntax errors or unsupported language version
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8118-9faa-c5832cd60588 }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81c0-bf64-c6d73f0df60d }}
  - generated files in scope
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81c0-bf64-c6d73f0df60d }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8122-bb42-c9711fbcb845 }}
  **Resolution**: fix the syntax error, or exclude the path via `[adapters].exclude`.
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8122-bb42-c9711fbcb845 }--
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81e2-9332-d6ca563a9700 }--

{{ ref: cabef50c-5028-437c-81aa-dcbb10f5368b, is_toggleable: true }}
### `AdapterBindFailure` (code: ADAPTER_BIND_FAILURE)
  {{ ref: f9e0468b-810c-4832-9d02-7df21f542186 }}
  **When thrown**: parsing succeeded but reference resolution failed structurally (e.g. unresolvable crate graph in the Rust binder).
  --{ ref: f9e0468b-810c-4832-9d02-7df21f542186 }--
  {{ ref: 90907450-6e36-4c44-a01e-ed8464f58963 }}
  **Common causes**:
  --{ ref: 90907450-6e36-4c44-a01e-ed8464f58963 }--
  {{ ref: 2e6a9ba1-c7e9-4948-94f7-ba1eee7f5efd }}
  - missing lockfile or broken workspace manifest
  --{ ref: 2e6a9ba1-c7e9-4948-94f7-ba1eee7f5efd }--
  {{ ref: eecdfb57-fc7a-4950-94d3-bf12b467721e }}
  - unresolved path dependencies
  --{ ref: eecdfb57-fc7a-4950-94d3-bf12b467721e }--
  {{ ref: cf61e2f8-02bc-45e0-958c-faadb9d36d11 }}
  **Resolution**: ensure the workspace builds (`cargo metadata` / `tsc --noEmit` succeeds), then re-run.
  --{ ref: cf61e2f8-02bc-45e0-958c-faadb9d36d11 }--
--{ ref: cabef50c-5028-437c-81aa-dcbb10f5368b }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81e3-82ce-c87394adfb20, is_toggleable: true }}
### `CandidateNotFound` (code: CANDIDATE_NOT_FOUND)
  {{ ref: b63b8b01-397d-4ded-9f76-498b16d8549f }}
  **When thrown**: `tree` or `diff` references a mode/index not present in the input.
  --{ ref: b63b8b01-397d-4ded-9f76-498b16d8549f }--
  {{ ref: ad81d82b-382f-4652-ac92-a1c5f59187fe }}
  **Common causes**:
  --{ ref: ad81d82b-382f-4652-ac92-a1c5f59187fe }--
  {{ ref: 15e7d93b-c299-4088-a82c-b6c6d7cd7cc2 }}
  - convergence returned fewer than k candidates
  --{ ref: 15e7d93b-c299-4088-a82c-b6c6d7cd7cc2 }--
  {{ ref: f68e70ef-d2d9-4420-b433-3229856babb5 }}
  - wrong mode name or index
  --{ ref: f68e70ef-d2d9-4420-b433-3229856babb5 }--
  {{ ref: e4e4ec64-654e-46d6-8313-0a7f326b55d9 }}
  **Resolution**: run `strata tree --input … --mode <m>` without `--candidate` to list what exists.
  --{ ref: e4e4ec64-654e-46d6-8313-0a7f326b55d9 }--
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81e3-82ce-c87394adfb20 }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8169-8e52-c1ed90df1889, is_toggleable: true }}
### `InputUnreadable` (code: INPUT_UNREADABLE)
  {{ ref: 3a8662db-ab41-460f-8a8e-eeadb17babac }}
  **When thrown**: `--input` is missing, not JSON, or has an unsupported `schemaVersion`.
  --{ ref: 3a8662db-ab41-460f-8a8e-eeadb17babac }--
  {{ ref: 8870a13a-ee86-4c5e-b8a5-ea34b6b407b5 }}
  **Common causes**:
  --{ ref: 8870a13a-ee86-4c5e-b8a5-ea34b6b407b5 }--
  {{ ref: ded3044e-0303-4de6-85e6-18b122d1a4a1 }}
  - result file from an incompatible Strata version
  --{ ref: ded3044e-0303-4de6-85e6-18b122d1a4a1 }--
  {{ ref: ea9bd3e1-c87a-4831-a736-c78d3779332e }}
  **Resolution**: regenerate with `strata analyze` from the same Strata version.
  --{ ref: ea9bd3e1-c87a-4831-a736-c78d3779332e }--
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8169-8e52-c1ed90df1889 }--

{{ ref: 1c5b0fac-a48d-4242-bd94-e7de95d7c2f8, is_toggleable: true }}
### `SnapshotInvalid` (code: SNAPSHOT_INVALID)
  {{ ref: 5206f04c-fcd5-4d84-a4ed-f2b6981a9251 }}
  **When thrown**: a snapshot passed to `analyze` fails validation — dangling edge endpoints, malformed container tree, or schema mismatch.
  --{ ref: 5206f04c-fcd5-4d84-a4ed-f2b6981a9251 }--
  {{ ref: 5f85ad1b-9a81-409e-8204-bba44c7a7a58 }}
  **Common causes**:
  --{ ref: 5f85ad1b-9a81-409e-8204-bba44c7a7a58 }--
  {{ ref: f7948909-4c22-4ce5-9d7a-831bcaff1184 }}
  - hand-edited snapshot or stale adapter build
  --{ ref: f7948909-4c22-4ce5-9d7a-831bcaff1184 }--
  {{ ref: e4cc00e0-99b2-4e89-bbd1-63fd60e264a7 }}
  **Resolution**: regenerate the snapshot with a current adapter build.
  --{ ref: e4cc00e0-99b2-4e89-bbd1-63fd60e264a7 }--
--{ ref: 1c5b0fac-a48d-4242-bd94-e7de95d7c2f8 }--

{{ ref: 8f2bc21a-2361-4513-95c3-05a9eb2f7c2a, is_toggleable: true }}
### `ReExportDepthExceeded` (code: RE_EXPORT_DEPTH_EXCEEDED)
  {{ ref: 35b4dce1-3242-4139-a523-dd30334843b7 }}
  **When thrown**: re-export flattening hits the chain depth guard (pathological barrel chains).
  --{ ref: 35b4dce1-3242-4139-a523-dd30334843b7 }--
  {{ ref: 90a3edca-feaa-468b-8af1-53eb2ae47193 }}
  **Common causes**:
  --{ ref: 90a3edca-feaa-468b-8af1-53eb2ae47193 }--
  {{ ref: 1a3c1a24-0dd0-4240-abd3-c107af8a77c0 }}
  - a barrel cycle (almost always)
  --{ ref: 1a3c1a24-0dd0-4240-abd3-c107af8a77c0 }--
  {{ ref: 2ab408b3-de76-48db-b25d-eedc7b5caa2c }}
  **Resolution**: inspect the reported chain; raise the guard only if the chain is legitimate.
  --{ ref: 2ab408b3-de76-48db-b25d-eedc7b5caa2c }--
--{ ref: 8f2bc21a-2361-4513-95c3-05a9eb2f7c2a }--

