{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8164-b462-c911eebb1819 }}
## 🗄️ File Structure
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8164-b462-c911eebb1819 }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-818d-abb8-e0c94174c561 }}
**Organizational Principles:**
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-818d-abb8-e0c94174c561 }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81dd-964b-eb58e0a5ecd5 }}
- **One crate per concern**: contract (`ir`), solver (`core`), per-language adapters, orchestration + public library (`engine`), shell (`cli`)
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81dd-964b-eb58e0a5ecd5 }--
{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81b8-b9ae-f008017f881a }}
- **Dependency discipline**: `core` and adapters depend only on `ir`; only `engine` sees both; the `cli` shell and external library consumers see only `engine`
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81b8-b9ae-f008017f881a }--
{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8135-9a52-d050dd9c87c4 }}
- **One module per pipeline phase** in `core` — each phase independently unit-testable
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8135-9a52-d050dd9c87c4 }--
{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-812c-8e41-f4fce85d26d7 }}
- **Naming conventions**: snake_case files per Rust convention; crate **package names** carry the `strata-` prefix (`strata-ir`, `strata-core`, `strata-adapter-typescript`, `strata-adapter-rust`, `strata-adapter-python`, `strata-engine`, `strata-cli`) while directories use the short name
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-812c-8e41-f4fce85d26d7 }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8156-a52f-c202a9276d3f }}
```plain text
strata/
  Cargo.toml                       # workspace manifest, shared lints and deps
  strata.toml                      # self-analysis config (dogfooding)
  crates/
    ir/
      src/
        lib.rs                     # public exports
        node.rs                    # node, node-kind, scope-level, polarity
        edge.rs                    # edge, edge-kind, hardness, confidence
        container.rs               # laminar container tree
        snapshot.rs                # snapshot assembly, validation, blake3 hash
        adapter.rs                 # shared adapter trait, source set, ir fragment
    core/
      src/
        lib.rs                     # public exports
        graph/
          csr.rs                   # compressed sparse row adjacency
          intern.rs                # identifier interning
        condense.rs                # iterative tarjan scc + condensation
        shatter.rs                 # mfas: ilp with lazy cycles + els heuristic
        layer.rs                   # longest-path layering
        cluster/
          coarsen.rs               # acyclicity-preserving heavy-edge matching
          seed.rs                  # topological greedy growing
          refine.rs                # fm moves with cycle and capacity vetoes
        pack.rs                    # capacitated cohesion-first file packing
        visibility.rs              # lca-based visibility derivation
        project.rs                 # test projection and polarity validation
        score.rs                   # objective evaluation and breakdowns
        diversify.rs               # multi-start pool + max-min vi selection
    adapter-typescript/
      src/lib.rs                   # swc parse + scope-analysis bind
    adapter-rust/
      src/lib.rs                   # syn parse + ra_ap cross-crate bind
    adapter-python/
      src/lib.rs                   # rustpython parse + custom scope bind
    engine/
      src/
        lib.rs                     # public library surface: analyze, snapshot_from_root
        config.rs                  # strata.toml schema + defaults
        snapshot.rs                # source discovery, fragment merge, re-export flattening, hashing
        result.rs                  # analyze-result dto assembly
    cli/
      src/
        main.rs                    # clap entry point
        commands/                  # analyze, tree, diff, violations, report
        render.rs                  # tty tables, trees, and summaries
```
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8156-a52f-c202a9276d3f }--

